@baseUrl = http://localhost:5077

### Start the API with: dotnet run --project src/Agora.Api
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness checks the database
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Predict: items is capped at 2; totalCount counts every match
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=tee&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

### Price, currency, and stock must match the same variant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=10&maxPrice=30&currency=usd&inStock=true&sort=price
Accept: application/json

### An unavailable variant can coexist with an available variant on a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?inStock=false
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 400 application/problem+json with validation errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=40&maxPrice=20

### Expected: 400, because the page offset exceeds the supported integer range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=2147483647&pageSize=100

### Search for a literal percent sign; it is not a match-everything wildcard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=%25
